WEBVTT

00:02:27.435 --> 00:02:30.605
hundreds of stories came rolling in.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:33.691
Stories like Amanda,

00:02:33.691 --> 00:02:36.110
who, after losing her baby
in the second trimester,

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:37.945
was standing frozen at her sink

00:02:37.945 --> 00:02:40.114
because she forgot how to wash dishes.

00:02:41.365 --> 00:02:42.783
Stories like Lula,

00:02:42.825 --> 00:02:44.911
whose chronic health
problems and depression

00:02:44.911 --> 00:02:47.121
made it difficult for her
to brush her teeth.

00:02:47.121 --> 00:02:51.542
Story after story of people
with depression, ADHD,

00:02:51.584 --> 00:02:53.377
autism, burnout, bereavement,

00:02:53.377 --> 00:02:56.380
all struggling with these daily tasks.

00:02:57.173 --> 00:02:58.925
And it might seem odd to some of you

00:02:58.925 --> 00:03:02.178
that someone could struggle
with tasks that are so simple.